Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.04,0:00:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.52,0:00:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,raising our voices, we take\Nin the beautiful blue world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to\Ngo, everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.42,0:00:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go, get the sails all unfurled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,La la la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.16,0:00:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are in between\Nthe sea and the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready now for adventure,\Nwe're itching to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to roam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So all aboard now we're said to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail to the ocean so deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for a truly grand adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well don't you think\Nthat sounds really fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All this excitement is second to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the\Nsea, Raising our voices we take!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.06,0:00:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In the beautiful blue world,\NOur spirits ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sales all unfurled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something that\NI just won't ever forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the way that I felt\Nwhen our journey was set.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I won't be scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.86,0:01:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I keep that feeling there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.24,0:01:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, let us keep up the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.46,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,While enjoying every\Ntrip from place to place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our timid hearts get the rhythm ingrained.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's keep going, adventure awaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures await!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in\Nhand, everybody rejoices!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.26,0:01:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Party on, cause we stand tall and proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous, be\Naware it's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou, now fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.28,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.62,0:02:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I took off my pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.38,0:02:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope no one saw me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's scary outside but\NI'm still having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.26,0:02:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All alone but I'm still having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.30,0:02:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,25 degrees!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.02,0:02:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, somebody look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:02:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wait, I'm the only one here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.24,0:03:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ho-ho-ho-ho-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.84,0:03:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Quark! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.12,0:03:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Get with the program already!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, pal, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.78,0:03:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We started an island!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.92,0:03:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a summer island!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.90,0:03:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out the beach!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.44,0:03:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, wait, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.10,0:03:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.58,0:03:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this real? You're alive!\NHurry up, Brook! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.82,0:03:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we can't get this\Nthing started without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.16,0:03:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.26,0:03:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy, but... Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.00,0:03:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you didn't die after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.86,0:03:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You were having a bad dream, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get over here and play a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.98,0:03:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.94,0:03:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it. That really hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That means this isn't a\Ndream, this is reality!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:03:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just a nightmare\Nafter all, thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Captain York made\Nit to the comm belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You think he'll be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.18,0:04:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a question for the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All we can do is carry\Nout his final orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll sail around the world\Nuntil we see Laboon again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.74,0:04:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.68,0:04:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have to do this every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.98,0:04:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The winds are too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.40,0:04:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The sail's gonna turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll sing our way through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, look at this, Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.22,0:04:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You got yourself a bounty. Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.56,0:05:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the problem, Brooke?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you stop to jam it? Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.26,0:05:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been jumping to my nose for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.06,0:05:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a moment, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.06,0:05:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.88,0:05:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you could do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a tone dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I purchased it from a\Nmerchant ship many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.46,0:05:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear there are many\Ndifferent kinds of dials,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but this one in particular has the\Nability to record and reproduce sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.74,0:05:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we saw those in Skypiea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.96,0:05:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you know how they work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.84,0:05:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.75,0:05:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,when I meet Laboon again, I\Nwant to play this for him,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's something I\Nalways keep in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.76,0:05:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So do you have something\Nspecial recorded on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.86,0:05:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.12,0:05:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the last song\Nperformed by my former crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.72,0:05:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Although they're all gone now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,we wanted to leave a\Nmessage to Laboon to let
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,him know that we were\Nmerry until the bitter end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.50,0:05:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,May I play it for you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, yeah, do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.38,0:05:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If Laboon will like it, I bet I will, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:05:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.90,0:06:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there any survivors?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely a few of us can still stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.92,0:06:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We got a couple men left,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't think there's much\Nhope left for us at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at least we're all\Ndying together, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.42,0:06:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess their weapons\Nwere all poison-tipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.06,0:06:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And our doctor's dead now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.42,0:06:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,When I became a pirate, I knew I might\Ndie on the seas, and I was ready for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still have just one regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.92,0:06:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Laboon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.50,0:06:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brooke, how does that devil\Nfruit of yours work? Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my first time dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, I have an idea. If\Nwe're going to die anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.16,0:06:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we sing a song
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.14,0:07:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what will happen Any\Nmore than you do But if the revive
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.88,0:07:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,revive fruit Really does bring me\Nback to life After I die here I will
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.40,0:07:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Deliver this to him without fail.\NThe tone dial I'll take. Laboon the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.52,0:07:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,song He and our captain love The\Nsong we've all shared so many times
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And when we meet at that cape,\Nhe'll know this crew died without.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.10,0:07:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,regrets that we kept our promise to\Nour dear Friend that's a great idea
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,all right men don't you dare die
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.20,0:07:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,until we finish this Song this is it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the rum bar pirates once-in-a-lifetime\Nperformance for our our friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.18,0:07:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,across the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.37,0:07:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is the song you're\Nplaying, we can all sing along!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.80,0:07:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.82,0:08:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-ho, yo-ho,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,yo-ho,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.32,0:08:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,yo-ho, yo-ho,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.50,0:08:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,yo-ho, yo-ho,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.86,0:08:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,yo-ho,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.74,0:08:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,yo-ho, yo-ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.64,0:08:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather up all of the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.00,0:08:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to ship up Aix's brew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sea wind blows to air.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.56,0:08:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows the waves will be our guide?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Or across the ocean's tide?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Rays of sunshine far and wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Birds they sing of cheerful things!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.62,0:08:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,In circles passing by!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.66,0:08:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bid farewell to Weaver's town!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.02,0:08:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Say so long to Port Renown!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing a song, it won't be long!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we're casting off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.22,0:08:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Across the gold and silver seas!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.60,0:09:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A salty spray puts us at ease!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Day and night to our delight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.72,0:09:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The voyage never rests!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.22,0:09:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather up all of the crew, it's\Ntime to ship out Binx's crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.34,0:09:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates, we eternally are\Nchallenging the scene!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.28,0:09:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,With the waves to rest our heads,\Nship beneath us as our beds!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.98,0:09:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoisted high upon the mast,\Nour jolly Roger flies!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Somewhere in the endless skies,\Nstormy winds are blowing like!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.66,0:09:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Waves are dancing, evening comes,\Nit's time to sound the drums!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.58,0:09:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But steady men and never fear,\Ntomorrow's skies are always clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.06,0:09:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So pound your feet and clap your\Nhands till sunny days return!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.98,0:09:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-ho-ho-ho,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.46,0:10:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather up all of the crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.60,0:10:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to ship out Binx's brew!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.72,0:10:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wave goodbye but don't you cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.90,0:10:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Our memories remain!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our days are but a passing dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Everlasting though they seem!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.42,0:10:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Neat the moon we'll meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.46,0:10:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The winds of the lullaby!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.34,0:10:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather up all of the crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to ship out Binx's brew!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.94,0:10:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing a song and play along!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,For all the ocean's wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.10,0:10:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,After all is said and done!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll end up a skeleton!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.18,0:10:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So spread your tail from dawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Till dusk upon each holy seas!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-ho-ho,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.16,0:11:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it would seem\Nwe're down to a quartet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.20,0:11:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A trio.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.14,0:11:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And a duet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A solo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't right Leaving\Njust the accompaniment
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.80,0:11:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to join my crew All\NI ask is that you love music
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.34,0:11:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it for the Rumbar Pirates The\Ncrew that brings a smile to every child
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.12,0:11:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The moon Once we travel the world\Nwe're coming right back here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:12:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You just wait for us
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.56,0:12:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.60,0:12:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.62,0:12:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Laboon, thank you for waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.10,0:12:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that 50 years is\Na long time, but please,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.86,0:12:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,do you think you could be\Npatient for one or two more?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.00,0:12:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have my pride as a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.38,0:12:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised you I would see you\Nagain after circling the globe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.12,0:12:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I intend to keep my word and\Nreturn from the right direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.66,0:12:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Skeleton!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:13:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You ain't singing anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.66,0:13:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,One more song!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.18,0:13:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.66,0:13:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,When this was recorded, my comrades\Nand I knew the end was near.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.66,0:13:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But we sang our hearts out, because this\Nwould be the Rumbar Pirate Swan song.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,For over 50 years, I sailed alone,\Ndrifting aimlessly in that dark, misty sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.02,0:13:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hearing this song was my only comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.44,0:13:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All alone on that giant ship,\Nthis made me feel human.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,In that sad and lonely place, it\Nwas my only link to other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.52,0:13:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.16,0:13:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I will proceed with a new strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.28,0:13:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can seal this tone dial away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Until it can finally fulfill\Nits original purpose. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.26,0:14:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He did that weird head thing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.68,0:14:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that Laboon is\Nwell and still waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.18,0:14:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My shadow has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and we're leaving the Devil's Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And although the voices in this\Ndial kept me sane all those years,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.34,0:14:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I must remember that\Nit was not for my sake?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.76,0:14:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,that they were first recorded.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.48,0:14:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a song for Laboon\Nto remember his old friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.18,0:14:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Every day on that boat was difficult\Nand there was no end in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I'd given up all hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad to still be alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.22,0:14:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I never gave up,\Nno matter how hard it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.10,0:14:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, of course, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I've waited so long for this day to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.80,0:15:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So, does the offer to join\Nyour crew still stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.64,0:15:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, welcome aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.80,0:15:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wado!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.71,0:15:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.54,0:15:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But good to have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.34,0:15:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally got our musician!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.42,0:15:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He may be all bones, but\Nhe sure knows how to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been wanting a\Nmusician since forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.86,0:15:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He had a heavy heart, but\Nhe's light as a father!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.26,0:15:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what do you\Ncall a singing skeleton?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.08,0:15:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, tell us, Brooke!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.12,0:15:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A natural bone singer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.46,0:15:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Bones, get him, it's funny, because,\Nyou know, get him, it's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.52,0:15:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.88,0:15:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The crew certainly is likely now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.02,0:15:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do we always have to\Nattract those types? So noisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on,\Nbut congratulations, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, thanks, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.96,0:15:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on, but cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.08,0:16:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confused too, but cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.12,0:16:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,45 degrees!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.76,0:16:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.76,0:16:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not after coming so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I may have been sidetracked for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.30,0:16:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm headed straight forward again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.20,0:16:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All the way around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to Twin Cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.46,0:16:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I know you'll be waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.42,0:16:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have to keep my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.50,0:16:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Both to you and my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.94,0:16:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So I will see this to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.18,0:16:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.26,0:16:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.60,0:16:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.86,0:17:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Le Boon, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.06,0:17:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you seem to be\Nin high spirits today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this—a wanted poster. You\Nmean you already have a bounty on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.70,0:17:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me for not introducing myself properly\Nbefore I am known as Dead Bones Brook
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.10,0:17:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm a wanted man my nickname\Nis the humming swordsman
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.06,0:17:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a bounty of 33 million\Nberries on my head. I was the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.14,0:17:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,leader of a battle convoy in the\Nkingdom of my origin afterwards
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.64,0:17:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I served As a musician and\Nswordsman in the rumbar pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.02,0:17:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,later succeeding yorkie as\Ncaptain of the crew Until their
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.84,0:18:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,demise but now I pledge my\Nlife and my services to Captain
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey D Luffy of the Straw Hat\NPirates I shall do my best to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.78,0:18:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,make you proud that is to say\NI shall work myself to the bone
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.76,0:18:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.67,0:18:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,One more toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.70,0:18:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.42,0:18:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.33,0:18:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Franky Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.62,0:18:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.20,0:18:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can make one of these\Nany day of the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.34,0:18:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was my design, just so you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.38,0:18:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I picked out the flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But truly, it's a beautiful memorial.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.82,0:18:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is certainly for the best,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.64,0:18:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,since I could scarcely bring\Nall of those bones onto Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:18:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.41,0:18:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but it's Thousand\NSunny, not Mr. Lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:19:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, by happy coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thriller Bark originally\Ncame from the West Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.44,0:19:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,just like the Rumbar Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.54,0:19:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite the troubles this ship brought me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.72,0:19:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope my friends will rest peacefully\Nin the soil of their homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.98,0:19:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna head back now Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.70,0:19:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.68,0:19:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you like it. Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.56,0:19:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.02,0:19:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.93,0:19:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,you gave me a fright You were out for\Nquite a while, are you feeling better?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.94,0:19:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I overslept a bit
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.72,0:19:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.86,0:19:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A dead sword, Yubashiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.84,0:19:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm laying it to rest here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.12,0:20:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Muffy is the man who\Nbecame king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.06,0:20:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.26,0:20:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.02,0:20:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.08,0:20:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, in case you hadn't heard,\NI officially joined the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.00,0:20:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.91,0:20:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's too bad for\Nyou now, isn't it? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.76,0:20:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This crew can be a real\Nhandful, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.00,0:20:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.36,0:20:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll give them my blood\Nand sweat all the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,except I don't have any\Nsince I'm a skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.72,0:20:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Zorro's up, so on to our next adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.26,0:20:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's time to set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.56,0:20:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.34,0:20:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.25,0:20:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, you took off your bandages!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.78,0:20:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.69,0:20:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They made it hard to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.26,0:20:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the point!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.34,0:20:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to sit still in a hill!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.35,0:20:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting off already?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.27,0:20:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry you can't stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.94,0:20:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever you feel like leaving,\Nyou can take Brooke's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.86,0:21:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I fixed the rudder and the sails for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.22,0:21:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't thank you enough\Nfor all you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.42,0:21:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It might take the rest of my life for me\Nto pay you back, but I'm willing to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, what do you\Nsay you and I get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.22,0:21:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, babe, you're a champ,\Nbut it won't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I'm just too\Nsuper to settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.38,0:21:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I really hate to see you take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.32,0:21:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you don't want to stick\Naround and party for a few more days?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.96,0:21:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.87,0:21:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We're off to Fishman Island, and\Nit's going to be totally awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Fish dudes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.02,0:21:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's going to be fish dudes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.12,0:21:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw the fish dudes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.38,0:21:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There are going to be mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.66,0:21:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to flirt with all of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.34,0:21:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if the mermaids\Nwe encounter would
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.74,0:21:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,be so gracious as to\Nshow me their panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.04,0:21:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, don't be dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.54,0:21:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about what you're saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.06,0:21:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mermaids don't wear any panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.50,0:21:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm telling you,\Nmermaids are so gorgeous,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.24,0:21:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,they even give the pirate empress\NHancock a run for her money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mermaids, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.95,0:21:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mermaids, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.28,0:21:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mermaids are fish from the waist down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.34,0:22:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you guys know so\Nmuch about Fishman Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.68,0:22:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, well, a couple years back before\Nwe got stuck in this hellhole,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.88,0:22:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,we took a trip there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.80,0:22:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You were gonna love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.60,0:22:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Lola, I didn't realize you\Nwent to the New World already.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.22,0:22:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't go there, you big silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.96,0:22:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We came from there in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.54,0:22:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My mama's a pirate just like me, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.88,0:22:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you should take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.72,0:22:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my mama's Viva card.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.78,0:22:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A piece of paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.24,0:22:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hang on to that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.80,0:22:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the greatest pirates\NI've ever met in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.20,0:22:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Lola's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.64,0:22:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll come in handy someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.36,0:22:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just anybody gets one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.38,0:22:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but what's a Viva card again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.36,0:22:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.27,0:22:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.19,0:22:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Captain, don't be insensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.84,0:22:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They only make Viva\Ncards in the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.12,0:22:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.82,0:22:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, this is no normal paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.80,0:22:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You can wet it or burn\Nit, but it won't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.58,0:22:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you take a piece of your fingernail\Nto the shop where they make these,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.76,0:22:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll use it to create a personalized\Npiece of paper, just like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.76,0:22:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of their use, they also call\NViva cards life paper sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.58,0:23:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The idea is to tear off\Na piece and give it to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.64,0:23:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,your family or friends\Nwhen you go on a journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.10,0:23:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. And then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.56,0:23:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.62,0:23:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Viva card I got for my mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.30,0:23:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.12,0:23:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where in the world these scraps\Nof paper are, they're drawn to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.88,0:23:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So long as I have this, I know\Nwhat direction mama is in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.20,0:23:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't tell you the\Ndistance, though, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.38,0:23:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's so neat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.18,0:23:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet there's a bunch of crazy stuff\Nlike that in the new world, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.62,0:23:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know about crazy,\Nbut it certainly is handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.48,0:23:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm signing the piece of my mama's\NViva card, so if you're ever in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.88,0:23:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,you can use it to find her\Nand she'll help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.62,0:23:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If that ever happens, be sure to\Ntell her that I'm doing fine, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.22,0:23:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, thanks, Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.60,0:23:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.60,0:23:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't I have one of those already?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.46,0:23:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.37,0:23:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot, but Ace gave you\Nsomething like this a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.58,0:23:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.48,0:23:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That scrap of paper\Nwill reunite us someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.00,0:24:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.30,0:24:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.72,0:24:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.18,0:24:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you said these\Nthings couldn't burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.58,0:24:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.66,0:24:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see that!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.82,0:24:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is definitely a Viva card,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.90,0:24:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's something I\Nneglected to tell you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.54,0:24:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The life force of the owner is\Nalso reflected on the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.92,0:24:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this belong to someone close to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.60,0:24:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's my big brother's.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.42,0:24:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.02,0:24:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to say this, but your brother's\Nlife is in terrible danger right now.
